# Safco catalog agent

Python 3.12, src layout (`src/safco/`), pydantic v2, type hints everywhere, mypy --strict clean, ruff clean.
No network calls in unit tests; use recorded HTML fixtures in `tests/fixtures/`.
Never log secrets. Config comes from `config.yaml` + env (pydantic-settings); no hard-coded selectors in code.
All crawling goes through `RobotsPolicy` + `RateLimiter`: there must be NO code path that fetches a URL without both. No flag may disable robots.txt compliance.
Agents are small classes behind Protocols, pure where possible (HTML in, data out). I/O lives in adapters.
Prefer small functions, explicit errors (custom exception types), structured JSON logging with `run_id`/`url`.
